"User: %1$s\n"
"IP Address: %2$s\n"
"Time: %3$s\n"
"\n"
"This is an automated alert from your WordPress security plugin."
msgstr ""
"Användare: %1$s\n"
"IP-adress: %2$s\n"
"Tid: %3$s\n"
"\n"
"Detta är en automatiserad varning från ditt WordPress-säkerhetsplugin."

