"We detected a login to your account from a new IP address:\n"
"\n"
"IP Address: %2$s\n"
"Time: %3$s\n"
"\n"
"If this was not you, please contact your site administrator immediately."
msgstr ""
"Hej %1$s,\n"
"\n"
"Vi upptäckte en inloggning till ditt konto från en ny IP-adress:\n"
"\n"
"IP-adress: %2$s\n"
"Tid: %3$s\n"
"\n"
"Om detta inte var du, vänligen kontakta din webbplatsadministratör omedelbart."

